<title>UK: London gold fixes firmer, business quiet.</title>
<headline>London gold fixes firmer, business quiet.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Fixes stronger at $323.45 versus $322.10 in the morning and $322.60 on Friday afternoon. Watching Wall Street, FOMC meeting for direction.</p>
<p>SILVER - Two cents firmer at $4.53/$4.55. Holding last Friday's gains, support at $4.50.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Off $5.00 at $411.50/$414.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Straddling psychological $200 level. Easier at $197.50/$200.50.</p>
</text>
